# CODEOWNERS.example - rename to CODEOWNERS once the repo is hosted
# (GitHub: .github/CODEOWNERS or repo root; GitLab: CODEOWNERS).
# Syntax: <path> <owner> - owners are auto-requested for review on PRs.

# Default owners for everything in the repository
# * @your-org/platform

# Shared modules - changes ripple into every env
# /modules/ @your-org/platform @your-org/senior-devs

# Production root module - enforces the two-reviewer rule (see AGENTS.md)
# /envs/prod/ @your-org/platform @your-org/leads

# Staging root module
# /envs/staging/ @your-org/platform

# Dev is open to all engineers
# /envs/dev/ @your-org/engineers
